<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Quantitative evaluation of generated images using different diffusion models on different prompts.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS2.SSS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.SSS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Notably, our <span id="S4.SS2.SSS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">WPM</span> technique is broadly applicable to all Stable Diffusion style models. Experimental results on SD 3.5 Medium and Playground v3 further validate the adaptability of our approach across various diffusion-based models.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<div id="S4.T2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:65.7pt;vertical-align:-30.2pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(11.7pt,-2.2pt) scale(1.0730216857928,1.0730216857928) ;">
<table id="S4.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
