<td id="A1.T4.2.1.2.2.1.30.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T4.2.1.2.2.1.30.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Now apply these rules to the following poem:</span></td></tr>
